        "5/4"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "explain": "The adjacent side is √(5² − 3²) = 4, so cos θ = 4/5.",
      "explainAf": "Die aangrensende sy is √(5² − 3²) = 4, dus is cos θ = 4/5."
    },
